#################################
##	Sample of Behavior file

Behavior

StartJitter		0.0 0.0 0.0
InitialVelocity		0.0 0.0 0.0
InitialVelocityJitter	0.0 0.0 0.00


Spin			0.00 .00 0.00
#SpinJitter		0.00 0.0 0.00

FadeInLength		0
FadeOutLength		0

Scale			1 1 1

TrackRate		1.4
TrackMethod		2

AnimScale 		0.01



Shake          2.0    #How much to shake the camera when event with this bhvr is created
ShakeFallOff   .03    #how long shake lasts
ShakeRadius    80.0  #(falls off slowly, so at 18.0 feet from center, only a mild shake)

LifeSpan		-1

End


